cff-version: 1.2.0
title: cil-krl - Kernelised Richardson-Lucy Deconvolution for PET
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Erlandsson
    given-names: Kjell
    email: kjell.erlandsson@kcl.ac.uk
    affiliation: King's College London
identifiers:
  - description: This software
    type: url
    value: https://github.com/KCL-BMEIS/KRL
repository-code: "https://github.com/KCL-BMEIS/KRL"
abstract: >-
  A CIL plugin implementing anatomically-guided (kernelised)
  Richardson-Lucy deconvolution for PET imaging, with CPU and GPU
  backends, MAP-RL with preconditioning, and directional total
  variation regularisation.
keywords:
  - PET
  - Richardson-Lucy
  - deconvolution
  - CIL
  - image reconstruction
